# Cursor Rules for Ukrainian Poetry & Suno Music Skills
- For Ukrainian poetry tasks, reference skills/ukrainian-poetry/SKILL.md.
- For Suno AI music prompting, reference skills/ukrainian-poetry-to-suno/SKILL.md.
- Musical sound design in Suno must always be grounded in Western genres (Post-Punk, Darkwave, Synthwave, Trip-Hop, Alt-Pop, Metalcore, Ambient) to eliminate sharovarshchyna and cheap regional pop.
- Style box: 80-180 chars, English only, no metadata tags (Language/Theme/Mood forbidden).
- Run tests with: py -3 tests/run_tests.py --all
